        "direct_body_paragraph_zero_based": 92,
        "paragraph_id": null,
        "text": "Furthermore the equations in (1.1) are averaged (over a suitable space or time scale) and the turbulent stress tensor is introduced to model the unresolved part of the flow. The turbulent stresses are then expressed in mean flow quantities using the Boussinesq hypothesis as"
      }
